            "text": "The scripted row proves a real nonzero MATH italic correction with Chromium/WPT's purpose-built U+2AFF font. Blink subtracts the correction from the subscript offset but not the superscript; the same script glyph on both sides makes ordinary spacing an exact control.",
            "markdown": "The scripted row proves a real nonzero MATH italic correction with Chromium/WPT's purpose-built U+2AFF font. Blink subtracts the correction from the subscript offset but not the superscript; the same script glyph on both sides makes ordinary spacing an exact control."
          },
